    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-24T21:18:31+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-24T21:18:31+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-24T10:48:31Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-24T10:48:31Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough and cold front continue moving across central and eastern parts tonight and over the far northeast on Sunday. A ridge of high pressure will then move into the west late Sunday and persist over much of southern SA through to mid-next week, as the associated high slowly drifts east across waters to the south. A trough and low pressure system may then develop near the WA border from late Wednesday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-24T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-25T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-24T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-24T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower. The chance of a thunderstorm, possibly severe with damaging winds and large hail south of Yunta. Winds northwest to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-25T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-26T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-24T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-25T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Very high chance of showers south of Yunta, medium chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning and afternoon, possibly severe with damaging winds in the far east. Winds south to southwesterly 35 to 55 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 15 and 24 with daytime temperatures reaching 21 to 36.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 4:50pm, UV Index predicted to reach 10 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-26T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-27T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-25T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-26T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower west of Leigh Creek, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek from the late morning. Winds southerly 20 to 30 km/h turning southeasterly 25 to 35 km/h early in the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 5 and 17 with daytime temperatures reaching 21 to 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-27T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-28T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-26T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-27T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers north of Leigh Creek, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek. Winds southeasterly 25 to 35 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 19 with daytime temperatures reaching 22 to 31.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-10-28T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-29T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-27T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-28T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers north of Leigh Creek, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek. Winds east to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 18 with daytime temperatures reaching 24 to 33.</text>
            </forecast-period>
